// Behaviour test for CTCInventoryClothing::ConstructScreen @ 0x005B76D1 (console clothing screen, vtable slot 77). Portable model of the
// row's logic in the row's statement order, over small UI / def / inventory mocks: the item sort (appearance modifiers by suit part; hero
